# Deceptive Landscape: each of the three listed basic land types is legal. Reject Island, reject Tundra because it is nonbasic, then find Plains, Swamp and Forest; each search puts its land onto the battlefield tapped (CR 205.4a, 305.6, 701.23).

[Bot1 Deck]
Deceptive Landscape x3
Plains x8
Forest x8
Island x8
Mountain x8
Swamp x8
Tundra x2

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

